    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">incŭbĭtus</span></b> ,
			ūs (only in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>abl. sing.</i>), m.
			incubo, <i>a lying upon</i> (Plinian).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dextri lateris,</span>”
				<i>a lying on the right side</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 4, 14, § 54</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., <i>a brooding</i>, <i>incubation</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 54, 75, §
		152</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
